/*
  AIWatchFaceNLResponse.strings
  TeslaSync — P4 shared surface · 0060 · AIWatchFaceNLResponse (Apple)

  The P1/S10 i18n catalog contribution for this surface. Every key the native surface
  resolves (table "AIWatchFaceNLResponse") lives here with its web `t(key, default)` English
  value. These entries fold into the app `Localizable.xcstrings` master catalog at integration
  time; they are kept in a per-surface table so each parallel surface prompt owns its own
  strings without editing the shared catalog.

  Group 1 is the exact set of keys from the web source
  (components/ai/AIWatchFaceNLResponse.tsx). Group 2 is the shared Helix scaffold keys the web
  `AIFeatureCard` / `AiOutputPanel` / `AIBadge` resolve (the universal "Ask Helix" CTA, the
  thinking label, the badge tooltip, the error label). Group 3 backs the native chrome — the
  P4 leaf freshness / loading / over-cap / error copy + the a11y answer-ready phrase — so the
  Swift sources hold no English literals.
*/

